arm64: dts: qcom: add Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra (SM-X910)

Add leaf DTS for Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra Wi-Fi (SM-X910 / gts9uwifi).
This skeleton is the minimum needed for the kernel build to succeed at
ubuntu-tab milestone-1; full body (panel topology, cs35l45 audio,
charging IC nodes, touchscreen, keyboard cover) is iterative authoring
post-first-boot per the project's per-track ADRs and fast-cycle module
hot-reload loop.

The leaf file name is SKU-keyed (sm8550-samsung-x910.dts) per the qcom
DTS naming convention (cf. DEC-196 R07-W3 + arm/qcom.yaml enum
extension samsung,gts9 + samsung,gts9plus + samsung,gts9u).

The factored sm8550-samsung-gts9-common.dtsi for Tab S9 family-common
content is in a companion patch in this series.

Signed-off-by: ubuntu-tab project <omarfityan@outlook.com>

